assistant.import.request:
Convert this Home Assistant automation into a Moli automation, as faithfully as possible.
Find the devices by their name and room in the inventory (the HA identifiers are only there to recognize them).
A voice announcement on the Sonos (script.announce_sonos, tts) → notify with the "maison" and "voix" channels, same text. A notification on a phone (notify.mobile_app_*) → notify with the "telephone" channel (the Moli app). What doesn't exist in Moli yet: Alexa, lists, counters, house modes, scripts, Jinja templates → closest equivalent or left out. Say in one sentence in note what is missing or was adapted.
A trigger's HA “for” = for_s on the trigger: don't add a wait on top.
Jinja templates ({{ … }}) are not understood by Moli: replace them with fixed text or with {{<point>}}.
